  "comments": "Some coins show a small &quot;Star of David&quot; on the obverse. These are set issues.<br /><br />\r\nDate of Issue: September 1967<br /><br />\r\nOf the coins dated 5733 (1973), 150,000 were minted in Jerusalem and 10,115,000 were minted in Bern.<br />\r\nOf the coins dated 5734 (1974), 2,287,000 were minted in Jerusalem and 4,000,000 were minted by the Royal Canadian Mint in Ottawa.<br />\r\nOf the coins dated 5735 (1975), 7,225,000 were minted in Jerusalem and 6,000,000 were minted by the Royal Australian Mint in Canberra.<br />\r\nOf the coins dated 5738 (1978), 11,129,000 were minted in Jerusalem and 36,391,000 were minted by the Royal Canadian Mint in Winnipeg.<br />\r\nOf the coins dated 5739 (1979), 10,615,464 were minted in Jerusalem and 24,200,000 were minted by the Royal Canadian Mint in Ottawa.",
